---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Carol's Manuscript — a long-form publishing project by George Carol.">
  <div class="max-w-reading mx-auto px-6 py-12 prose">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      <strong>Carol's Manuscript</strong> is a long-form publishing project designed around reflective writing,
      warm minimalism, and handcrafted digital aesthetics.
    </p>

    <p>
      The project combines timeless theological reflection with practical startup and systems thinking.
    </p>

    <Divider />

    <h2>Philosophy</h2>

    <p>
      Carol's Manuscript exists to create a slower, more thoughtful corner of the internet.
    </p>

    <p>It values:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Clarity over noise</li>
      <li>Wisdom over speed</li>
      <li>Craftsmanship over trends</li>
      <li>Substance over performance</li>
    </ul>

    <Divider />

    <h2>Author</h2>
    <p>Written by <strong>George Carol</strong>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
